      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: this line is 74 columns. Would you mind rewrapping the paragraph at 72? For example:\n\n```\nLimit a 4KB process to the requested DMA allocation size rounded up to\n4KB. The allocation can own additional padding up to a native 16KB\nboundary, but do not expose that extra range to a 4KB VMA. This is a\nconservative bounds policy, not a fix for an observed application\nfailure. For example, an 8193-byte object permits 12288 bytes, not\n16384 bytes.\n```",
      "isAi": true,
